WEB.2:
a time to be born,

and a time to die;

a time to plant,

and a time to pluck up that which is planted;

WEB.3:
a time to kill,

and a time to heal;

a time to break down,

and a time to build up;

WEB.4:
a time to weep,

and a time to laugh;

a time to mourn,

and a time to dance;

WEB.5:
a time to cast away stones,

and a time to gather stones together;

a time to embrace,

and a time to refrain from embracing;

WEB.6:
a time to seek,

and a time to lose;

a time to keep,

and a time to cast away;

WEB.7:
a time to tear,

and a time to sew;

a time to keep silence,

and a time to speak;
